				"id": 930001,
				"name": "Grave Tender",
				"isHomebrew": false,
				"description": "<p>You kept the quiet fields at the edge of a town, and you know the names on every stone.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Intelligence, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> Alert</p>",
